Bioinfomatic analysis pipeline for Accumulation of Benzalkonium Chloride from Disinfectants in Dust Associated with Increased Microbial Tolerance
doi: https://doi.org/10.64898/2026.04.14.26350823
The script has been sanitized to remove cluster usage details and personal information.

RGI/CARD: Run the scripts using Singularity on the Quest cluster.

Mobilome Annotation Pipeline (MAP): Use Singularity to run the software. No batch script is provided in this repository; please refer to the official website for usage instructions.
https://github.com/EBI-Metagenomics/mobilome-annotation-pipeline
